 "note": "S, 13 platforms. Each home is a keep: two towers (its walls) and a LIFT gate in front. The lift DOWN opens the keep's door and the front gate (home - lift - the courtyard), the lift UP shuts both and joins the two towers behind it (a wall walk: move the garrison between the towers without leaving the keep). Out of each keep: the front gate to the courtyard's side corner, the top tower's curved road to the crown (N), the bottom tower's curved road to the south corner (S). The centre is open: a rotor swings its spokes between N / S and the two side corners. Finale: the courtyard diamond round the rotor (plan said triangle: a rotor inside a triangle fails N13 / G13 - its spokes need the same count per state and 120 degrees; see the role note).",
